{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game Overview<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3739360/extras/e28e66612395350e9a249f92ae18e329.poster.avif?t=1758507028\" width=616 height=236 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3739360/extras/e28e66612395350e9a249f92ae18e329.webm?t=1758507028\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3739360/extras/e28e66612395350e9a249f92ae18e329.mp4?t=1758507028\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0<i>The Grim Gamble</i> is a first-person, local multiplayer board game for 1 to 4 players.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0Outsmart your opponents, read their intentions, and rely on a bit of luck to survive a deadly game of life and death.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Story<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3739360/extras/2e2b372ccaefdf360e931488155dc878.poster.avif?t=1758507028\" width=616 height=236 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3739360/extras/2e2b372ccaefdf360e931488155dc878.webm?t=1758507028\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3739360/extras/2e2b372ccaefdf360e931488155dc878.mp4?t=1758507028\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0As darkness falls, four chosen gamblers gather in a shadowy arena.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0The air is thick with decadence, pleasure\u2014and madness.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0The moment you sit at the table, your wrists are locked into cold steel restraints.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0Running down the center is the grotesque <i>Saw Train</i>, a mechanical executioner that demands a \u201cpayment\u201d from the loser\u2014by severing their hand.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0All you have are your wits, your instincts, and a dash of luck.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0This is a card battle where your life is on the line.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0\u201cWelcome to <i>The Grim Gamble</i>.\u201d</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game Rule<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3739360/extras/b36fd5a93325682ae7e1916432769fea.poster.avif?t=1758507028\" width=616 height=236 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3739360/extras/b36fd5a93325682ae7e1916432769fea.webm?t=1758507028\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3739360/extras/b36fd5a93325682ae7e1916432769fea.mp4?t=1758507028\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>How to Play \u2013 \u201cMAX OUT\u201d</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0Each player is dealt one card\u2014but you can\u2019t see your own.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0Instead, you must observe everyone else\u2019s cards and guess:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0\u201cWhat\u2019s the total value of all the cards?\u201d</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0Catch the lies, push the limit, and say the highest number you can without going over.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0You only get three chances.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0Lose three games, and it\u2019s game over.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3739360/extras/459a99d8e7a447d76409261ad6bb2cf0.poster.avif?t=1758507028\" width=616 height=236 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3739360/extras/459a99d8e7a447d76409261ad6bb2cf0.webm?t=1758507028\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3739360/extras/459a99d8e7a447d76409261ad6bb2cf0.mp4?t=1758507028\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>How to Play \u2013 \u201cFULL BODY\u201d</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each player is dealt 4 cards.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are three types of cards: Head, Arms, and Legs.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Players take turns playing one card at a time until a total of 8 cards are stacked in the center.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The first card you play is placed face up; the second card is placed face down.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cards are then revealed from the top of the stack one by one.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The player who exactly completes a Full Body\u20141 Head, 2 Arms, and 2 Legs\u2014wins.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After seeing the first face-up card, try to complete the Full Body on your turn!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3739360/extras/553f71f5150476238253d4cbc514fd38.poster.avif?t=1758507028\" width=616 height=236 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3739360/extras/553f71f5150476238253d4cbc514fd38.webm?t=1758507028\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3739360/extras/553f71f5150476238253d4cbc514fd38.mp4?t=1758507028\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Play Time</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The average play time for this game is between 10 and 30 minutes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Video Streaming Guidelines</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Permission to Stream: Streaming is allowed without any prior permission for both individuals and organizations. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Monetization: Monetization is allowed only if the platform's features are used. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Disclaimer: We take no responsibility for any damages resulting from streaming videos of this game. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Possible Changes: These guidelines are subject to change without notice.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3739360?t=1758507028","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3739360?t=1758507028","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3739360/eacb774e4da66577f9292e61fbd5ed46fb342bf6/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1758507028","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3739360/eacb774e4da66577f9292e61fbd5ed46fb342bf6/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1758507028","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":"This game contains content that may not be suitable for all ages or appropriate for viewing in a workplace setting. It includes frequent depictions of violence, gore, and other mature content."},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game Overview<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3739360/extras/e28e66612395350e9a249f92ae18e329.poster.avif?t=1758507028\" width=616 height=236 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3739360/extras/e28e66612395350e9a249f92ae18e329.webm?t